# UI layout and print

- Metric cards: `h-full flex flex-col justify-between`. Fixed-height title+icon row, value, subtext `mt-auto`. All five cards identical height.
- Quick-add modal: strict `grid-cols-2`. Equal-height label rows so inputs align horizontally. Do not put helper text inside a 2-col cell.
- Ledger: `table-fixed w-full`, no `min-w-*` and no horizontal scroll. Project column truncates (`max-w-0 overflow-hidden truncate`).
- PDF is `window.print()` plus `@media print` in `app/globals.css`. No canvas, jspdf, or html2canvas.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Table className="min-w-[920px]" />

// ✅ GOOD
<Table containerClassName="overflow-x-hidden" className="w-full table-fixed" />
```
